cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, cite the v2.1.0 release and preserve record-level source attributions."
title: "Chinese Internet and ICT Reports QA Dataset / 中文互联网与 ICT 报告问答数据集"
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
authors:
  - family-names: Dong
    given-names: Tingshuo
url: https://github.com/dongtingshuo/chinese-internet-and-ict-reports-qa-dataset
repository-code: https://github.com/dongtingshuo/chinese-internet-and-ict-reports-qa-dataset
license: other
abstract: >-
  A mixed record-level licensed Chinese source-grounded QA candidate dataset.
  The v2.1.0 active package contains 2,508 records: the exact v2.0.0 corpus
  plus 508 source-reconstructed questions. All records are in the recommended
  subset per dataset-owner instruction; review status remains explicit, and no
  dataset-wide human review or gold status is claimed.
